<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>The flow of funding which has help=
ed the AI industry to grow rapidly could be running dry</strong>, at least =
for some firms in the cloud computing world, Elon Musk has warned.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The world=E2=80=99s richest person declare=
d last night that at least 200 =E2=80=9Cneo-clouds=E2=80=9D =E2=80=93 compa=
nies which provide specialised cloud infrastructure to run AI workloads =E2=
=80=93 could die or consolidate because they will struggle to access capita=
l.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Musk is referring to the guppy fish, the c=
olourful freshwater aquarium fish notorious for dying suddenly in the aquar=
ium.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Musk made the claim while also declaring t=
hat his <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_Jk=
LMEmFuifc_XG18IR0JRNkgBBrBsaFz1BS69vPRzi8AtjNHaDnxS4_iB8LtvQuhMqikiPz_mWK-2=
_iHOTkhNCQ3U22EvfCxNyEl2ImBjosuKE1dKfaWisgqXC6u-3O9zj0EXDd9YuTdIY5xoZk94fWa=
g4O4Z9udygtWFwsTE39tFrsyWVg-7t9iwZqPuGRIoxM1Jo_vYjJtN3JVlhH36LK2FE4TDNF2e6G=
vWiw8/4v7/iGemQPI3SLWeJtmQhZHN-Q/h30/h001.-3dnsFmkb5gN5N01sEbAZIuPYk6cFUXhC=
vbUnxqTI3I" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">SpaceX</a> business has closed a $40b=
n (=C2=A330bn) debt deal to pay for the chips it needs for its AI work, alt=
hough Bloomberg questions whether it is a done deal.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Musk posted on X that firms who rely on re=
venue streams from AI datacentres are being cold-shouldered by lenders, say=
ing: =E2=80=9CAs of the past few weeks, debt markets have almost entirely s=
hut off access to money for any company that doesn=E2=80=99t have substanti=
al revenue independent of AI datacentres.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CSpaceX closed $40bn of debt for G=
PUs, but we=E2=80=99re investment grade and have Starlink &amp; launch reve=
nue. That means the 200-plus neo-clouds are going to see guppy-level death =
and consolidation. Some will make it through, but not many.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Neo-clouds are specialist cloud providers =
that rent out clusters of high-speed Nvidia chips to firms looking to condu=
ct AI training and inference.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">They include CoreWeave, the US firm whose =
share price has fallen 60% in the last year as investors question whether t=
he huge investment in AI datacentres will be rewarded with lucrative cash f=
lows.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The cost of insuring CoreWeave=E2=80=99s d=
ebt against default has climbed in recent weeks to levels that typically su=
ggest credit distress. (Musk=E2=80=99s comments are unlikely ease investors=
 concerns!)</p>
